{
  "name": "变化自身Shape Self（浆人）",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/creatures/slimes/slime-movement-pseudopods-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>先决条件：</strong> 浆人Plasmoid</p><p>使用一个动作，你可以重塑你的身体，长出一个头，一或两只胳膊，一或两条腿，以及临时的手和脚，你也可以变回没有肢体的一团浆。当你具有人类般的身形时，你能穿着和你体型相同的类人生物的衣服和护甲。</p><p>使用一个附赠动作，你能挤出一条伪足，该伪足至多6寸宽，10尺长，或是将伪足吸收回你的身体里。作为该附赠动作的一部分，你能用这条伪足操纵一个物件，打开或关闭一扇门或容器，或是捡起或放下一个微型物件。这条伪足不具有感知器官，不能用来攻击，启动魔法物品，或是举起超过10磅重的物体。</p><p>As an action, you can reshape your body to give yourself a head, one or two arms, one or two legs, and makeshift hands and feet, or you can revert to a limbless blob. While you have a humanlike shape, you can wear clothing and armor made for a Humanoid of your size.</p><p>As a bonus action, you can extrude a pseudopod that is up to 6 inches wide and 10 feet long or reabsorb it into your body. As part of the same bonus action, you can use this pseudopod to manipulate an object, open or close a door or container, or pick up or set down a Tiny object. The pseudopod contains no sensory organs and can't attack, activate magic items, or lift more than 10 pounds.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
